pg-mooncake (0.2.0-1PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rebuild with cargo-pgrx/pgrx 0.19.1 using the RPM-verified patch.
  * Build PostgreSQL 18 from the fixed Cargo.lock without mutating it.
  * Require the matching pg-duckdb 1.1.1 provider package at runtime.
  * Serialize the cross-major build while retaining Cargo's inner parallelism.

 -- Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 17:00:00 +0800

